features.description:
In UserProfilesService, emit:
- 'user.profile.created' { userId, createdAt, timezone }
- 'user.profile.onboarding.updated' { userId, stage, updatedAt, completedAt? }
- 'user.profile.deleted' { userId }
- 'user.profile.simulation.updated' { userId, simulation: Partial<...>, updatedAt }
Remove StatisticsUserService usage from DynamoDbUserProfilesRepository (repositories remain persistence-only). Update tests to verify emits from service and no direct stats calls from repository.

Emit from WhatsAppCoreService/WhatsAppOutboundService:
- 'whatsapp.outbox.enqueued' { outboxId, userId, phoneE164, bodyText, template? }
- 'whatsapp.outbox.delivered' { outboxId, deliveredAt, providerMessageId }
- 'whatsapp.outbox.failed' { outboxId, error }
- 'whatsapp.inbox.received' { id, fromWaid, type, text?, button?, userId?, contextMessageId? }
- 'whatsapp.session.inbound.touched' { userId, phoneE164, atIso }
Worker integration: before/after send, emit delivery.requested (optional), delivered/failed outcomes. Add tests to assert emissions and preserve existing behavior.

From ConversationsCoreService, emit:
- 'conversations.message.created' { messageId, userId, type, createdAt }
- 'conversations.message.assistant.duplicateFlagged' { messageId, userId, duplicateOfId }
Listeners (phase 2): statistics per-message metrics. Add unit tests for emissions. No behavior change beyond events in this phase.

From AudioRecordingsService, emit:
- 'audio.recording.started' { userId, id, createdAt }
- 'audio.recording.completed' { userId, id, durationSeconds }
- 'audio.recording.canceled' { userId, id }
Add unit tests verifying emissions at appropriate state transitions.

From CheckIns scheduler/service, emit:
- 'checkins.scheduled' { userId, scheduleAt }
- 'checkins.sent.whatsapp' { userId, outboxId }
Add unit tests verifying emissions. Future listeners in WhatsApp/Analytics may use them.

From Goals services, emit:
- 'goals.macro.created' and 'goals.macro.updated' { userId, goalId }
- 'goals.micro.created' and 'goals.micro.updated' { userId, goalId }
Add unit tests verifying emissions. No listeners required in this phase.
